.Sh HISTORY
The provider MAC interface was introduced in OpenSSL 3.0. The parameters
"no-short-mac" and "fips-indicator" were added in OpenSSL 3.4.
.Pp
The function
.Fn OSSL_FUNC_mac_init_skey
was introduced in OpenSSL 3.5.
